                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "He thought the medicine tasted <w>yucky</w> and refused to swallow it.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "zh": "他觉得药的味道很<w>恶心</w>，拒绝吞下去。",
                                "cs": "Myslel si, že ten lék chutná <w>nechutně</w>, a odmítl ho spolknout."
                            }
